# Advisory for shared/downstream caches: a request with a different Accept
# or User-Agent can resolve to a different body at the same URL (see the
# markdown-for-agents rewrite rule in ../cloudflare-rules.md). Cloudflare's
# own edge cache is unaffected — the rewrite changes the URI before cache
# lookup, so the HTML and Markdown variants are already distinct cache keys.
/*
  Vary: Accept, User-Agent
